ty as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section testimonials HDLmClass7dc6e6ce\\\">\\n  <h2>What Our Customers Are Saying</h2>\\n  <div class=\\\"testimonial-grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"testimonial-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-label=\\\"5 out of 5 stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n      <blockquote>&ldquo;I've outfitted my entire studio with YogaDirect mats, blocks, and bolsters. The quality rivals brands that cost twice as much, and bulk ordering was effortless. My students constantly ask where we get our gear!&rdquo;</blockquote>\\n      <div class=\\\"author\\\">Sarah M.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"role\\\">Studio Owner, Harmony Yoga Collective</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"testimonial-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-label=\\\"5 out of 5 stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n      <blockquote>&ldquo;As a daily practitioner for over 10 years, I'm picky about my mat. YogaDirect's extra-thick mat has the perfect balance of grip and cushion, and it has held up beautifully through hundreds of sessions.&rdquo;</blockquote>\\n      <div class=\\\"author\\\">David R.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"role\\\">Yoga Practitioner &amp; RYT-200 Teacher</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"testimonial-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-label=\\\"5 out of 5 stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n      <blockquote>&ldquo;When we opened our second location, YogaDirect made it easy and affordable to stock everything from straps to blankets. Fast shipping, great prices, and customer service that actually cares.&rdquo;</blockquote>\\n      <div class=\\\"author\\\">Priya K.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"role\\\">Owner, Lotus Flow Yoga Studios</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <p>&copy; YogaDirect. Serving the Yoga community since 1999. All rights reserved.</p>\\n</footer>\\n</body>\\n