 src=\\\"/images/products/premium-yoga-mat.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Premium Yoga Mat\\\">\\n<h3>Premium Yoga Mat</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (312)</div>\\n<div class=\\\"price\\\">$24.95</div>\\n<a href=\\\"/premium-yoga-mat/\\\" class=\\\"add-to-cart\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"product-card HDLmClass33644c6e\\\">\\n<img src=\\\"/images/products/yoga-bolster.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Supportive Round Yoga Bolster\\\">\\n<h3>Supportive Round Yoga Bolster</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (198)</div>\\n<div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.95</div>\\n<a href=\\\"/yoga-bolster/\\\" class=\\\"add-to-cart\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"product-card HDLmClass33644c6e\\\">\\n<img src=\\\"/images/products/foam-yoga-block.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Foam Yoga Block\\\">\\n<h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; (256)</div>\\n<div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div>\\n<a href=\\\"/foam-yoga-block/\\\" class=\\\"add-to-cart\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"product-card HDLmClass33644c6e\\\">\\n<img src=\\\"/images/products/yoga-strap.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cotton Yoga Strap\\\">\\n<h3>Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (174)</div>\\n<div class=\\\"price\\\">$6.95</div>\\n<a href=\\\"/cotton-yoga-strap/\\\" class=\\\"add-to-cart\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</main>\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n<h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Why Shop YogaDirect?</h2>\\n<p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n</section>\\n<section class=\\\"testimonials HDLmClass4f9d8ff\\\">\\n<h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">What Our Customers Say</h2>\\n<div class=\\\"testimonial-grid\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n<p>\\\"YogaDirect has been our studio's go-to supplier for over five years. The quality is outstanding and the prices let us outfit every class affordably.\\\"</p>\\n<cite>&mdash; Sarah M., Studio Owner</cite>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n<p>\\\"Fast shipping and fantastic mats. I ordered bolsters and blocks for a retreat and everything arrived on time and in perfect condition.\\\"</p>\\n<cite>&mdash; David R., Retreat Organizer</cite>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n<p>\\\"The best value in yoga gear I've found anywhere. My mat has held up beautifully through daily practice for two years.\\\"</p>\\n<cite>&mdash; Priya K., Yoga Practitioner</cite>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n<section class=\\\"newsletter HDLmClassfe31c4f0\\\">\\n<h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2>\\n<p>Join our newsletter for exclusive deals, new product announcements, and yoga tips.</p>\\n<form action=\\\"/newsletter-signup\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n<input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required>\\n<button type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 10% Off</button>\\n</form>\\n</section>\\n<footer>\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<p>\\n<a href=\\\"/about-us/\\\">About Us</a>\\n<a href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\">Contact Us</a>\\n<a href=\\\"/shipping/\\\">Shipping</a>\\n<a href=\\\"/returns/\\\">Returns</a>\\n<a href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">Wholesale</a>\\n<a href=\\\"/privacy-policy/\\\">Privacy Policy</a>\\n</p>\\n<p>&copy; 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. Faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999.</p>\\n</div>\\n</footer>\\n</body>\\